{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>3 DIFFERENT GAME MODES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Linear Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features a <strong>linear experience</strong> with a mini story and hidden easter eggs. Find the correct sequence and <strong>don't forget it</strong>! Complete the levels that become more relaxing over time and achieve absolute victory against the simulation. <br><u><i>Includes a special game mode for speedrunning.</i></u><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551600/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1740912340\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Test Your Luck:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no way to <strong>memorize</strong> the correct path here. Enter randomly generated rooms, take risks, progress, and try to achieve the highest score. <br><u><i>Includes three different difficulty modes.</i></u><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551600/extras/GIF2.gif?t=1740912340\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Waiting Room (2-Player Mode):</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The waiting room mode is designed for <strong>local multiplayer</strong>. Enter the waiting room and enjoy the <strong>thrill of anticipation</strong>! In this completely unpredictable experience, you either win and pass your turn to the other player or face the <strong>scary woman</strong>\u2026 Designed for couples and friends to have fun together. <br>Will something <strong>jump out</strong> on the screen? When will it happen? These uncertainties make this mode so <strong>entertaining</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551600?t=1740912340","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551600/63dccd4c1763b7400e73ba3e3d68b8a0ff3222a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740912340","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steam